NOTES\P1. Dimensions to tube centre lines; 700c (622) wheels, clearance for 35 mm tyres (min 4 mm gap all round, checked in 3D).\P2. Fit geometry = published Hektor 53 (stack 498, reach 406, HTA 73.5, STA 75.0). Head tube 105 (pub. 120) for a 380/45 
  3
fork; BB drop 48.3 as Hektor.\P3. Horizontal TT measures 539 at stack height; published 530 is inconsistent with published stack/reach/STA (same 9-10 mm in all sizes).\P4. Rear axle slot: chainstay 395-409 (min set by tyre/seat tube). 60T/22T + 115T 
  1
belt sits at 401.5.\P5. Trail 55.6 mm. Toe overlap approx. 28 mm (170 cranks) - expected with track geometry and large tyres.\P6. Fork, wheels and sprockets shown as reference only (phantom). DXF is 1:1 - do not scale the PDF.
